"comparison": "Both MS and BAC disclose that credit loss estimation relies on complex models and subjective judgments that may prove inaccurate. MS cites specific external factors like geopolitical events and pandemics as drivers of unexpected losses (ms_2024_1A_P018_S002), while BAC similarly highlights the uncertain macroeconomic and geopolitical environment as increasing the sensitivity of their judgments (bac_2024_1A_P039_S001). Both acknowledge that future economic conditions differing from forecasts can lead to losses exceeding estimated reserves.",
