"peer_disclosure_id": "c_2024_1A_D029",
"relationship": "same_topic",
"comparison": "Both MS and C emphasize that reserves for credit losses are based on judgments and estimates that may differ from actual future events. MS states that valuations and reserves rely on complex models and subjective judgments (ms_2024_1A_P018_S001) and that future conditions could lead to inaccurate measurement (ms_2024_1A_P018_S002). C similarly states that reserves are subject to judgments and estimates that could be incorrect or differ from actual future events (c_2024_1A_P107_S001).",
