"relationship": "same_topic",
"comparison": "Both disclosures discuss the impact of weakening economic conditions on borrower repayment ability and collateral liquidation. MS notes that sudden declines in collateral value may result in losses despite credit monitoring (ms_2024_1A_P018_S004). C elaborates that weakening economic conditions can adversely affect borrowers' ability to repay and result in Citi being unable to liquidate collateral or forced to liquidate at prices that do not cover the full amount owed (c_2024_1A_P105_S003).",
