"relationship": "same_topic",
"comparison": "Both MS and GS identify disputes over collateral valuation as a source of risk and potential loss. MS mentions that disputes with counterparties over the valuation of collateral may lead to higher-than-anticipated credit losses (ms_2024_1A_P018_S003). GS notes that disputes may arise as to the amount of collateral entitled and the value of pledged assets, particularly during financial difficulty or market stress (gs_2024_1A_P062_S002, gs_2024_1A_P062_S004).",
